  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/934/626/justinnether.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1345\" height=\"663\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">新物种：牛人。牛人与猪灵相似，他们诞生于下界，对黄金情有独钟。这两个部落经常为了争夺黄金而展开激烈的战斗。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/929/118/bullkin.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"104\" height=\"229\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/929/119/zombified-bullkin.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"106\" height=\"234\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/929/120/bullkin-brute.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"105\" height=\"235\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">钝人！！！！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074911/description_0d3fcfe2-65b7-4924-ae8d-642433a2be09.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"247\" height=\"178\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074911/description_bcb20491-4a63-4828-92ef-208ea8714f84.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"255\" height=\"184\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">两位新的首领将分别代表猪灵和牛人阵营，率领各自的军队投入战斗。然而，你们是他们共同的目标。</span><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074911/description_690902e2-dd26-4236-811f-d402b840a627.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"222\" height=\"254\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074911/description_d4226ccb-d271-4516-9826-10b2853a7ad1.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"559\" height=\"233\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">新的矿石以及由其制成的工具和盔甲。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#a4a4a4\">一切都与你的生命值息息相关。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074911/description_0a5d6927-4995-4026-994f-5f673b961f5f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"413\" height=\"197\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:804px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6HwsqHTA6e0\" width=\"796\" height=\"489\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@laucheringEN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lauchering</a> 制作的 YouTube 介绍视频。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>尽情享受吧！！！！！<br><br></p>\n<h1>需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a>！！！！</h1>\n<p>所有配方均显示在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> 中！</p>\n<p>你也可以点击&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/justinoway/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">'这里'</a>&nbsp;查看我的其他模组。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waterspirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_8352932c-51cc-446f-a9c0-3432ea713f5f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-cave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_66b3ac9b-9dba-4397-ac85-a748dda2f17a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_ed4c5d95-6b78-4b39-b0ce-ee106820067c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-wizard-hat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074911/description_968091b1-ce4f-4d62-b528-fa86f228a0fe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-garden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_72853ade-db70-4112-90c9-b1ca0bd1af78.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-lol-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090007/description_8e2c4f41-8277-4c7a-aa16-ece5a408a323.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1066741/description_c4977f41-7a78-41e8-911d-fbd4eded70ef.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1066741/description_9459cb9d-a740-4e92-b8a4-dd6c0ff68f4c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-blacksmith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1066741/description_9459cb9d-a740-4e92-b8a4-dd6c0ff68f4c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-kitchen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090007/description_f5c43518-c635-4b41-b335-901dd0ec6399.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-bank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1091821/description_c73eca2d-4dba-437d-b237-a9020c261e2c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p>这些项目都是我独自开发的，因此更新进度可能稍慢。如果你在经济上宽裕且喜欢我制作的模组，赞助我将使我能够更专注于模组的开发，而不必为收入担忧。此外，你还可以在赞助留言中告诉我你希望我更新的内容！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/justinoway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ewebinar.com/hubfs/Ko-fi-Logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"318\" height=\"104\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252flotsofadding%253fcountry.x%253dTW%2526locale.x%253dzh_TW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ecf0f1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1068761/description_590800f8-dda0-4e66-aa70-923107834d70.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"314\" height=\"157\"></span></a></p>\n<p>这对我真的很有帮助。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>抱歉我的英语不太好 :(</p>",
